Drive tracking is substantially more reliable in this release.

- Trips now close within about a minute of you parking and walking away, instead of waiting on a timer.
- A stop at a train crossing, drive-through, or long light no longer splits one drive into two.
- Drives keep their full shape even when your phone's clock drifts.
- Miles are priced at the correct IRS rate for the date you drove, including the mid-year rate change.
- Manually entered and reconstructed trips are protected and never overwritten.
- Vehicle costs are no longer double-counted against the standard mileage rate.
- Your year-end CPA export now includes tracked mileage on Schedule C.
